---
import { page, asset } from '../utils/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Stand Design" active="stand-design">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">

      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">Stand designs</span>

        <h1>Designed To Make An <span>Impact</span></h1>

        <p>
          Creative stand designs tailored to your brand, space and audience.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href={page('contact/')} class="hero-btn">
            Get a Quote
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <img
          src={asset('assets/images/8.stand-design/hero.png')}
          alt="Professional promotional banner stands"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-content">
       
    <section>
      <h2>Stand Design</h2>
    
      <p>
        You've booked your exhibition space, you know the
        message you want to communicate, but you're not
        quite sure how to bring it all together. That's
        where Efexacademy can help. We provide
        <strong>creative exhibition stand design and
        professional project management</strong>,
        transforming your ideas into engaging, practical,
        and visually impressive exhibition environments.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Whether you're planning a small promotional display
        or a larger exhibition presence, we understand the
        importance of making the most of your available
        space. Our approach combines creative thinking
        with practical experience to develop stand designs
        that reflect your brand, attract attention, and
        provide a welcoming environment for visitors.
      </p>
    
      <h3>From Concept to Design</h3>
    
      <p>
        Every successful exhibition stand begins with a
        clear understanding of your objectives. Following
        an initial briefing and design consultation,
        we'll work closely with you to explore your
        requirements, discuss your ideas, and establish
        a design direction that complements your branding,
        budget, and exhibition goals.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Throughout the design process, we provide detailed
        colour visuals, photorealistic renderings, and
        fully dimensioned CAD elevations. These allow
        you to visualise the proposed stand, understand
        how the space will be used, and make informed
        decisions before the build begins.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        From graphic placement and display positioning
        to visitor flow and presentation areas, we
        consider both the visual appearance and practical
        functionality of your stand. Our aim is to create
        an exhibition environment that not only looks
        impressive but also supports your business
        objectives.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Project Management &amp; Delivery</h3>
    
      <p>
        A successful exhibition involves more than
        creating an attractive design. Careful planning,
        coordination, and attention to detail are
        essential to ensuring everything comes together
        smoothly.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Efexacademy can project manage the stand build,
        working alongside show organisers and relevant
        suppliers to coordinate the practical requirements
        of your exhibition. From planning and preparation
        through to the final stages of delivery, we aim
        to make the process as straightforward and
        stress-free as possible.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        With over 20 years of industry experience,
        we understand the challenges involved in
        exhibition planning and the importance of
        meeting deadlines. Our commitment is to
        deliver a professional, well-considered
        exhibition stand that represents your brand
        with confidence and helps you make a lasting
        impression.
      </p>
    </section>
    
    <section class="row text-center image-content">
      <div class="col-sm-6">
        <img
          src={asset('assets/images/8.stand-design/image1.jpg')}
          alt="Custom exhibition stand design featuring branded display areas and promotional graphics"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    
      <div class="col-sm-6">
        <img
          src={asset('assets/images/8.stand-design/image2.jpg')}
          alt="Professional exhibition stand with branded presentation space and promotional displays"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="row text-center image-content">
      <div class="col-sm-6">
          <img src={asset('assets/images/8.stand-design/image1.jpg')} alt="Portable modular exhibition stand setup at a conference" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-6">
          <img src={asset('assets/images/8.stand-design/image2.jpg')} alt="Brand event display stand with promotional materials" />
        </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
